# Phone access with a fixed link (see "Phone access" in README.md).
# 1. Copy this file to  .ngrok.env  (that name is git-ignored, so your token never reaches GitHub).
# 2. Fill in the two values from https://dashboard.ngrok.com :
#      NGROK_AUTHTOKEN  ->  "Your Authtoken" page
#      NGROK_DOMAIN     ->  "Domains" page, your free domain WITHOUT https://, e.g. name.ngrok-free.dev
# 3. Start the demo with start_demo.bat (Windows) or ./start_demo.sh.
NGROK_AUTHTOKEN=
NGROK_DOMAIN=
